            <p><span class="lang-en">A growing collection of licensed photographs traces red-brick Melaka, Kuala Lumpur at night, the rail-and-ferry crossing and Penang’s living heritage. The feature view advances automatically; pause it at any time or choose a photograph below.</span><span class="lang-zh">不断扩充的授权照片串起红砖马六甲、吉隆坡夜景、火车与渡轮，以及槟城仍在生活中的古城文化。主画面会自动轮播，也可随时暂停或从下方选择照片。</span></p>
