            <p><span class="lang-en">Where the screenshots conflict, the more detailed draft is shown as the working plan. New Melaka and George Town ideas are marked “suggested.”</span><span class="lang-zh">两张截图有冲突时，本页采用较详细版本作为暂定计划。新增的马六甲与乔治城安排均标为“建议”。</span></p>
