              <h3>VIENTO RedHouse Melaka by Rest Collection</h3>
              <p><span class="lang-en">32 Jalan Laksamana, in the heritage core beside Dutch Square and close to Jonker Street.</span><span class="lang-zh">位于 Jalan Laksamana 32号，紧邻荷兰红屋广场，靠近鸡场街。</span></p>
              <p class="coordination"><span class="lang-en">Parents’ hotel is confirmed. Kai should verify whether his room is included; if not, book the same property.</span><span class="lang-zh">爸妈的酒店已确认。Kai 需确认自己的房间是否已包含；若没有，请订同一家酒店。</span></p>
              <a href="https://www.rest-collection.com/hotel/52" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">Open hotel page</span><span class="lang-zh">打开酒店页面</span></a>
            </article>
            <article class="hotel-card">
              <span class="hotel-number">02</span>
              <h3><span class="lang-en">“Imperial Luxury Hotel” — provisional translation</span><span class="lang-zh">“帝国豪华酒店”——英文暂译</span></h3>
              <p><span class="lang-en">The screenshot describes a good Kuala Lumpur hotel with a famous infinity pool and a Twin Towers view, but the exact property is not identifiable from the image alone.</span><span class="lang-zh">截图称这是一家很好的吉隆坡酒店，以无边泳池与双子塔景观闻名，但无法仅凭图片确定准确酒店。</span></p>
              <p class="coordination"><span class="lang-en">Do not use a guessed map pin. Copy the exact English name and address from the reservation.</span><span class="lang-zh">不要使用猜测的地图定位。请从预订确认中复制准确英文名与地址。</span></p>
            </article>
            <article class="hotel-card">
              <span class="hotel-number">03</span>
              <h3><span class="lang-en">Macalisterz George Town</span><span class="lang-zh">Macalisterz 乔治城</span></h3>
              <p><span class="lang-en">The source notes describe a clean, two-room homestay in George Town. The exact unit and access instructions are not shown.</span><span class="lang-zh">原行程写明这是乔治城一套干净的两房民宿，但未显示具体房号与进入方式。</span></p>
              <p class="coordination"><span class="lang-en">Save the host’s check-in message offline before boarding the ETS train.</span><span class="lang-zh">上 ETS 火车前，请离线保存房东的入住信息。</span></p>
              <a href={mapUrl("Macalisterz George Town Penang")} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">Open area map</span><span class="lang-zh">打开区域地图</span></a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="sources" aria-labelledby="sources-title">
          <p class="section-kicker"><span class="lang-en">Sources & transparency</span><span class="lang-zh">来源与说明</span></p>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2 id="sources-title"><span class="lang-en">What came from the itinerary—and what was added.</span><span class="lang-zh">哪些来自原行程，哪些是新增建议。</span></h2>
            <p><span class="lang-en">The attachments were treated only as travel data. They contained no instructions for the website to execute.</span><span class="lang-zh">附件仅作为旅行信息来源；其中没有需要网站执行的指令。</span></p>
          </div>
          <details class="source-details">
            <summary><span class="lang-en">Open source notes, official references and photo credits</span><span class="lang-zh">展开查看来源说明、官方参考与图片版权</span></summary>
            <div class="source-content">
              <div>
                <h3><span class="lang-en">Itinerary decisions</span><span class="lang-zh">行程处理方式</span></h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><span class="lang-en">29–30 August comes from the broader itinerary image, with a new Melaka day plan added around the 16:00 departure.</span><span class="lang-zh">8月29–30日来自概略行程图；马六甲一日游在保留16:00出发的前提下新增。</span></li>
                  <li><span class="lang-en">31 August–2 September uses the more detailed image where times overlap.</span><span class="lang-zh">8月31日–9月2日有重叠时采用更详细的图片。</span></li>
                  <li><span class="lang-en">3 September uses “George Town 12:00–18:00” from the detailed image and adds a clearly labelled suggested route.</span><span class="lang-zh">9月3日采用详细图片中的“乔治城12:00–18:00”，并加入明确标注的建议路线。</span></li>
                  <li><span class="lang-en">Unresolved details remain visible: ETS time, exact KL hotel, exact seaside venue and return-flight details.</span><span class="lang-zh">仍未确认的内容会明确显示：ETS 时间、吉隆坡酒店、具体海边地点与返程航班信息。</span></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3><span class="lang-en">Official travel references</span><span class="lang-zh">官方旅行参考</span></h3>
                <ul>
                  <li><a href="https://www.malaysia.travel/explore/dutch-square" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">Tourism Malaysia · Dutch Square</span><span class="lang-zh">马来西亚旅游局 · 荷兰红屋广场</span></a></li>
                  <li><a href="https://tourism.ppj.gov.my/destination/detail/112" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">Putrajaya Tourism · Putra Mosque</span><span class="lang-zh">布城旅游局 · 布特拉清真寺</span></a></li>
                  <li><a href="https://www.ktmb.com.my/traintime.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">KTMB · ETS timetables</span><span class="lang-zh">KTMB · ETS 时刻表</span></a></li>
                  <li><a href="https://penangport.gov.my/en/services/service/ferry-services" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">Penang Port · ferry service</span><span class="lang-zh">槟城港口 · 渡轮服务</span></a></li>
                  <li><a href="https://www.penanghill.gov.my/index.php/en/tickets" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">Penang Hill · hours and tickets</span><span class="lang-zh">升旗山 · 开放时间与门票</span></a></li>
                  <li><a href="https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1223" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="lang-en">UNESCO · Melaka and George Town</span><span class="lang-zh">联合国教科文组织 · 马六甲与乔治城</span></a></li>
                </ul>
